category: Libs
requires: libarchive-devel libcairo-devel libcfitsio-devel libcgif-devel libexif-devel libexpat-devel libfftw3-devel libfontconfig-devel libglib2.0-devel libhwy-devel libjpeg-devel liblcms2-devel libmatio-devel libopenexr-devel libopenjp2-devel libpango1.0-devel libpng-devel libraw-devel librsvg2-devel libtiff-devel libuhdr-devel libvips-cpp42 libvips-devel libwebp-devel pkg-config zlib-devel
sdesc: "Fast image processing library with low memory needs (development / c++)"
ldesc: "VIPS is a free image processing system. It is good with large images (images
larger than the amount of RAM you have available), with many CPUs (see
Benchmarks for examples of SMP scaling, VIPS is also part of the PARSEC
suite), for working with colour, for scientific analysis and for general
research & development. As well as JPEG, TIFF and PNG images, it also supports
scientific formats like FITS, Matlab, Analyze, PFM, Radiance and OpenSlide."
external-source: libvips

